alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_Sewers_Exchange_Letter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4a2e4087-4f60-4ee6-9d0f-18eb2290db78</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4a2e4087-4f60-4ee6-9d0f-18eb2290db78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4a2e4087-4f60-4ee6-9d0f-18eb2290db78\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a traveller's crate in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a> near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arabella\" title=\"Arabella\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/25px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/38px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/50px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arabella\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/25px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arabella\" title=\"Arabella\">Arabella</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-117&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;789</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Everything is here, just as I promised to my favourite customer. These were <i>not</i> easy to slip past both <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak\" title=\"Bonecloak\">Bonecloaks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Fists</a> - I assume you will be prompt in leaving my payment in the usual manner. \n</p><p><br>\nUntil next time, \n</p><p><br>\nYour Faithful Procurer.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715064022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43853/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9075/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1194233/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.478      1 -total\n 98.35%   47.678      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 56.41%   27.345      9 Template:Icon_text\n 50.75%   24.603     24 Template:Trim\n 28.20%   13.671      5 Template:Uid\n 13.27%    6.434      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.18%    6.387      5 Template:Template_style\n 10.80%    5.236      2 Template:Icon_link\n  9.72%    4.714      9 Template:Ifempty\n  8.53%    4.134      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47176-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715064022 and revision id 374068. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}